key   i085_sum_da        int     -       "I007/085/SUM/DA: Subfield #1: Mode 5 Summary (Mode 5, Extended Mode 1 and X-Pulse). 0 = No authenticated Mode 5 Data reply or Report, 1 = Authenticated Mode 5 Data reply or Report (i.e any valid Mode 5 reply type other than ID)"
key   i085_sum_m1        int     -       "I007/085/SUM/M1: Subfield #1: Mode 5 Summary (Mode 5, Extended Mode 1 and X-Pulse). 0 = Mode 1 code not present or not from Mode 5 reply, 1 = Mode 1 code from Mode 5 reply"
key   i085_sum_m2        int     -       "I007/085/SUM/M2: Subfield #1: Mode 5 Summary (Mode 5, Extended Mode 1 and X-Pulse). 0 = Mode 2 code not present or not from Mode 5 reply, 1 = Mode 2 code from Mode 5 reply"
key   i085_sum_m3        int     -       "I007/085/SUM/M3: Subfield #1: Mode 5 Summary (Mode 5, Extended Mode 1 and X-Pulse). 0 = Mode 3 code not present or not from Mode 5 reply, 1 = Mode 3 code from Mode 5 reply"
key   i085_sum_mc        int     -       "I007/085/SUM/MC: Subfield #1: Mode 5 Summary (Mode 5, Extended Mode 1 and X-Pulse). 0 = Mode C altitude not present or not from Mode 5 reply, 1 = Mode C altitude from Mode 5 reply"
key   i085_pmn_pin       int     -       "I007/085/PMN/PIN: Subfield #2: Mode 5 PIN/National Origin/Mission Code; PIN Code (Mode 5, Extended Mode 1 and X-Pulse)"
key   i085_pmn_nat       int     -       "I007/085/PMN/NAT: Subfield #2: Mode 5 PIN/National Origin/Mission Code; National Origin (Mode 5, Extended Mode 1 and X-Pulse)"
