key   i085_em1_l         int     -       "I007/085/EM1/L: Subfield #5: Extended Mode 1 Code in Octal Representation (Mode 5, Extended Mode 1 and X-Pulse). 0 = Mode-1 code derived from the reply of the transponder, 1 = Mode-1 code not extracted during the last scan"
key   i085_em1_em1       int     -       "I007/085/EM1/EM1: Subfield #5: Extended Mode 1 Code in Octal Representation; Extended Mode 1 Code in Octal Representation (Mode 5, Extended Mode 1 and X-Pulse). raw value: 4 octal digits of 3 bits each"
