key   i085_xp_xc         int     -       "I007/085/XP/XC: Subfield #7: X Pulse Presence; X-pulse from Mode C Reply (Mode 5, Extended Mode 1 and X-Pulse). 0 = X-pulse set to zero or no Mode C reply, 1 = X-pulse set to one (present)"
key   i085_xp_x3         int     -       "I007/085/XP/X3: Subfield #7: X Pulse Presence; X-pulse from Mode 3/A Reply (Mode 5, Extended Mode 1 and X-Pulse). 0 = X-pulse set to zero or no Mode 3/A reply, 1 = X-pulse set to one (present)"
key   i085_xp_x2         int     -       "I007/085/XP/X2: Subfield #7: X Pulse Presence; X-pulse from Mode 2 Reply (Mode 5, Extended Mode 1 and X-Pulse). 0 = X-pulse set to zero or no Mode 2 reply, 1 = X-pulse set to one (present)"
key   i085_xp_x1         int     -       "I007/085/XP/X1: Subfield #7: X Pulse Presence; X-pulse from Mode 1 Reply (Mode 5, Extended Mode 1 and X-Pulse). 0 = X-pulse set to zero or no Mode 1 reply, 1 = X-pulse set to one (present)"
